One create/list/read surface per capability, tenant-scoped, authenticated, and
fail-closed: a handler that reports a block failure is answered as a refusal
(HTTP 200, ``ok: false``) and nothing is stored. Validation refusals are 422 and
state the field and the reason as data, so a caller can correct them.
"""

from __future__ import annotations

import importlib
